flowchart TD
  A[Order PENDING] --> B{Inventory result}
  B -->|Rejected| F[Order FAILED]
  B -->|Reserved| C{Payment result}
  C -->|Failed| R[Release inventory]
  R --> F
  C -->|Authorized| D{Fulfillment result}
  D -->|Created| S[Order CONFIRMED]
  D -->|Completed| C[Order COMPLETED]
  D -->|Transient failure| T[Bounded retry]
  T --> D
  D -->|Retry budget exhausted| U[Refund payment]
  U --> V[Release inventory]
  V --> W[Order FAILED]
  U -.->|Compensation failure| X[FAILED_REQUIRES_REVIEW + alert]
  A -->|Cancel request| Q[CANCEL_REQUESTED]
  Q --> I0{Inventory reserved?}
  I0 -->|No| W2[Order CANCELLED]
  I0 -->|Yes| Y{Payment authorized?}
  Y -->|No| R2[Release inventory]
  R2 --> W2
  Y -->|Yes| Z[Refund payment]
  Z --> V
  V --> W2
  S -->|Cancel request| E{Shipment cancellable?}
  E -->|No| N[409 no state change]
  E -->|Yes| Z
